flowchart TD
    A[Receive customer feedback] --> B{Message blank?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Request message text]
    B -- No --> D[Send message to AI classifier]
    D --> E[Choose Delivery, Technical Support, or Billing]
    E --> F[Check output format and reason]
    F --> G{Clear and plausible?}
    G -- No --> H[Flag for human review]
    G -- Yes --> I[Compare with test expectations]
    I --> J{Correct category?}
    J -- No --> H
    J -- Yes --> K[Record verified category]
    H --> L[Human reviews and corrects if needed]
    L --> M[Record final result]
    K --> M
